{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393730/extras/746c179f3cb3eb0f386477f01ed9e9b5.poster.avif?t=1767585151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393730/extras/746c179f3cb3eb0f386477f01ed9e9b5.webm?t=1767585151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393730/extras/746c179f3cb3eb0f386477f01ed9e9b5.mp4?t=1767585151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Pilots</strong> is an indie flight simulator that doesn't aim to be the most &quot;realistic&quot; flying game ever, but rather offers a fun, stylised experience centred on the pilot's career. Developed by someone who truly loves aviation, it delivers a rich and immersive world where you manage many aspects of flight \u2014 from dealing with routes and passengers to buying and maintaining your own planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-Gaming Vibes - Pixelated Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive Pilot's Career</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several flyable Turbo-Props and Regional Jets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, detailed fictional world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified Navigation System (Radio-Compass)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manageable Crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Air Traffic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Air Companies Ranking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted with depth and care, Legendary Pilots is designed to offer an engaging, full-featured experience for aviation enthusiasts.</p><p c